WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.172 --> 00:00:04.834
Mayor Hubbletree glared at Waldo.

2
00:00:04.854 --> 00:00:07.535
"Change my son back right now!"

3
00:00:07.595 --> 00:00:08.476
"I'm trying!"

4
00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.719
Waldo waved his wand back and forth.

5
00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:17.581
Timothy the porcupine ran frantically around the gym.

6
00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:34.046
Monsters jumped out of his way.

7
00:00:35.507 --> 00:00:37.549
Suddenly Pop, pop, pop!

8
00:00:38.229 --> 00:00:40.111
The balloons drifted down.

9
00:00:40.531 --> 00:00:43.414
Many of them landed on Timothy, instantly popping.

10
00:00:44.094 --> 00:00:45.636
The sound was deafening.

11
00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:49.719
As the balloons popped, the performers came out of their trances.

12
00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.844
Maddy dropped everything she'd been juggling—the monster children and the dodo eggs.

13
00:00:55.404 --> 00:00:58.527
Sarah hurried up the ladder to help Deb down from the trapeze.

14
00:01:00.132 --> 00:01:02.574
"Help!" Winnie cried, still hanging from the rafter.

15
00:01:02.594 --> 00:01:03.955
"Hold on, Winnie!"

16
00:01:04.235 --> 00:01:04.896
Ben called.

17
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:08.058
"Brunhilda has her broom—she's flying up to get you!"

18
00:01:08.799 --> 00:01:11.701
A minute later Winnie was safe on the gym floor.

19
00:01:15.945 --> 00:01:16.465
And poof!

20
00:01:17.046 --> 00:01:19.207
Timothy turned back into a human child.

21
00:01:19.227 --> 00:01:21.369
"Yay! I did it!"

22
00:01:21.669 --> 00:01:23.851
Waldo jumped up and down with excitement.

23
00:01:23.871 --> 00:01:28.535
"That was fun, Dad!"

24
00:01:28.895 --> 00:01:29.636
Timothy said.

25
00:01:30.192 --> 00:01:31.552
Mayor Hubbletree groaned.

26
00:01:33.933 --> 00:01:37.294
Ringmaster Ronny looked dazed as he gathered everyone around.

27
00:01:37.314 --> 00:01:41.755
"Performers, let's go backstage for a few minutes.

28
00:01:42.395 --> 00:01:49.137
My assistant"—he shot a frown at Sarah—"obviously has some explaining to do.

29
00:01:50.778 --> 00:01:52.258
You should come too, ghost!"

30
00:01:52.758 --> 00:01:53.899
He beckoned to Ben.

31
00:01:57.079 --> 00:01:59.040
Backstage, Sarah hung her head.

32
00:01:59.928 --> 00:02:04.992
"I was really scared of monsters so I hypnotized all of you."

33
00:02:05.012 --> 00:02:08.015
"What?" Mog blinked.

34
00:02:08.035 --> 00:02:14.340
"How?" "I trained you to go into a trance whenever you heard the word 'sludge.'

35
00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:17.643
And then I popped bubbles to snap you out of it.

36
00:02:18.123 --> 00:02:20.205
I'm sorry," Sarah added.

37
00:02:20.225 --> 00:02:27.050
"I just wanted to make Ronny's circus school a big success—and keep things under control."

38
00:02:30.752 --> 00:02:32.613
"Hooray!" Mr.

39
00:02:32.653 --> 00:02:33.794
Freaky ran over.

40
00:02:33.814 --> 00:02:36.236
"Everything is under control?"

41
00:02:37.277 --> 00:02:39.338
"Not exactly," Winnie murmured.

42
00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:41.380
"The circus was a disaster."

43
00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.022
Maddy nodded, looking sad.

44
00:02:44.042 --> 00:02:47.164
"Can we still put on a show?"

45
00:02:48.485 --> 00:02:49.405
Everyone looked at Mr.

46
00:02:49.445 --> 00:02:51.667
Freaky. "Um."

47
00:02:52.107 --> 00:02:53.628
His noses began to wiggle.

48
00:02:53.648 --> 00:02:58.272
"Do you think you can do it the Monster Academy way this time?"

49
00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:01.293
The performers exchanged glances.

50
00:03:01.313 --> 00:03:04.474
"Yes!" "Okay then."

51
00:03:04.934 --> 00:03:06.355
Mr. Freaky hurried away.

52
00:03:06.375 --> 00:03:09.396
"I'll make an announcement to the audience."

53
00:03:10.597 --> 00:03:11.897
Sarah looked confused.

54
00:03:11.917 --> 00:03:15.198
"What's the Monster Academy way?"

55
00:03:15.219 --> 00:03:17.319
"We'll show you!"

56
00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:18.500
Mog said.

57
00:03:20.581 --> 00:03:22.702
Soon the circus began again.

58
00:03:22.722 --> 00:03:28.424
Ben watched with his family as Maddy came out first, juggling three bowling pins.

59
00:03:29.768 --> 00:03:33.029
Next Zork walked across a very low tightrope.

60
00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:39.592
Cleo walked around on stilts without trying to spin anything—or anyone.

61
00:03:40.973 --> 00:03:46.315
Then Deb and Winnie took turns swinging from a trapeze bar while Sarah watched closely.

62
00:03:47.976 --> 00:03:53.458
The grand finale featured Mog, who climbed into the cannon so Ronny could shoot him across the gym.

63
00:03:53.798 --> 00:03:58.160
Boom! Mog soared through the air, landing safely on a mat.

64
00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.502
"Awesome!" Mog cried.

65
00:04:05.064 --> 00:04:08.367
When the show was over, even Mayor Hubbletree looked pleased.

66
00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:11.569
He brought Timothy over to meet the performers.

67
00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.011
Timothy grinned shyly up at Mog.

68
00:04:15.031 --> 00:04:18.634
"The monster cannonball act was so cool!

69
00:04:19.134 --> 00:04:22.797
When I get bigger, I want to go to Monster Academy too!"

70
00:04:23.377 --> 00:04:25.679
Mayor Hubbletree cleared his throat nervously.

71
00:04:28.084 --> 00:04:30.666
"We'll discuss that later, Timothy."

72
00:04:31.607 --> 00:04:33.349
Mr. Scribblebottom joined the group.

73
00:04:33.369 --> 00:04:36.111
"I captured the whole circus on film.

74
00:04:36.492 --> 00:04:40.235
Oh, and Ronny, I'd like to make my next documentary about your circus school.

75
00:04:40.355 --> 00:04:41.216
Is that possible?"

76
00:04:42.077 --> 00:04:42.897
Ronny beamed.

77
00:04:42.917 --> 00:04:44.659
"Of course!"

78
00:04:44.679 --> 00:04:47.882
"First, can you explain something to me?"

79
00:04:48.222 --> 00:04:49.703
Mr. Scribblebottom asked.

80
00:04:49.723 --> 00:04:52.566
"What's the wrath of the circus?"

81
00:04:53.487 --> 00:04:54.668
Ben leaned forward.

82
00:04:55.212 --> 00:04:59.435
He'd been wondering about that question ever since the circus school had arrived.

83
00:05:00.415 --> 00:05:01.316
Ronny flushed.

84
00:05:01.336 --> 00:05:03.877
"I have no idea.

85
00:05:04.178 --> 00:05:07.760
I just made it up to intrigue students and make sure they behave!"

86
00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:09.721
Everyone laughed.

87
00:05:14.684 --> 00:05:20.408
A minute later, as Hank and Huck began to take down the circus equipment, Winnie approached Ben.

88
00:05:23.508 --> 00:05:25.129
"Can I help you with Bones tomorrow?"

89
00:05:25.589 --> 00:05:26.770
she asked softly.

90
00:05:27.751 --> 00:05:28.591
Ben grinned.

91
00:05:28.611 --> 00:05:33.614
"I thought you'd never ask!"

92
00:05:38.997 --> 00:05:42.900
The next day Ben and Winnie played with Bones in Ben's backyard.

93
00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.481
They played fetch and tug-of-war.

94
00:05:47.482 --> 00:05:51.868
Then they laughed as he chased a deadjay.

95
00:05:51.888 --> 00:05:54.429
"Bones is having a great time," Ben said.

96
00:05:54.449 --> 00:05:57.010
"And he's not digging in my mom's garden."

97
00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:01.552
"Exercise is really important for skeleton dogs," Winnie said.

98
00:06:01.572 --> 00:06:05.514
"If you walk him more often and give him lots of playtime, he'll behave better.

99
00:06:06.374 --> 00:06:09.455
You should teach him commands too, but exercise is great."

100
00:06:10.135 --> 00:06:10.956
Ben nodded.

101
00:06:10.976 --> 00:06:13.397
"My mom will be really happy if it works.

102
00:06:14.637 --> 00:06:17.598
Speaking of happy, I'm glad you're not mad at me anymore."

103
00:06:17.618 --> 00:06:21.100
"The whole thing was my fault," Winnie said.

104
00:06:21.568 --> 00:06:23.629
"You were just trying to warn me about the circus."

105
00:06:24.389 --> 00:06:25.290
She shook her head.

106
00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:28.951
"I guess the hypnosis was affecting me in strange ways."

107
00:06:28.971 --> 00:06:34.013
"Luckily Sarah Swingwire learned a lesson," Ben said.

108
00:06:34.033 --> 00:06:37.615
"She won't be using hypnosis to train performers anymore."

109
00:06:41.556 --> 00:06:43.557
Ben tossed the ball for Bones again.

110
00:06:44.237 --> 00:06:46.799
But to his surprise, Bones didn't chase it.

111
00:06:47.359 --> 00:06:49.880
Instead the dog flopped down, panting.

112
00:06:51.136 --> 00:06:52.637
Ben's mother came outside.

113
00:06:52.657 --> 00:06:55.799
"Now, that's what I call a well-behaved dog!

114
00:06:56.539 --> 00:06:57.720
What's your training secret?"

115
00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.561
Ben glanced at Winnie and smiled.

116
00:07:00.581 --> 00:07:02.723
"We'll never tell!"
